flowchart TD
 Start((Start)) --> Home[Fresh splash then Home]
 Home --> Browse[Browse products]
 Browse --> Detail{View details?}
 Detail -->|Yes| Read[Read details and select quantity]
 Read --> Add[Add product]
 Detail -->|No| Add
 Add --> More{Shop more?}
 More -->|Yes| Browse
 More -->|No| Cart[View or change cart]
 Cart --> Empty{Cart empty?}
 Empty -->|Yes| Notice[Show Browse action]
 Notice --> Browse
 Empty -->|No| Review[Snapshot cart and obtain token]
 Review --> Input[Enter details and review]
 Input --> Valid{Valid input?}
 Valid -->|No| Error[Show field errors and retain input]
 Error --> Input
 Valid -->|Yes| Matches{Cart and token match review?}
 Matches -->|No| Changed[Reject stale review]
 Changed --> Cart
 Matches -->|Yes| Submit[Create immutable order cache token and clear cart once]
 Submit --> Confirm[Show demo confirmation]
 Confirm --> End((End))
